      "value": "The vast majority of these issues should no longer occur. Marking this as complete.\n\nThe only time this may still occur is if the user having the problem is experiencing pretty major network issues.\n\nIf you're still experiencing issues with not receiving Invites that you *know for a fact that were sent* (as in, verified via speaking to the sender), please let us know by sending us a support ticket at http://help.vrchat.com/new. Ensure that you include your output log, as well as the method you used to verify that the original invite was sent.",
